<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>OpenClaw OmniRoute Bridge — Local AI Control Center</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/dashboard.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body><main class="container">
  <h1>OpenClaw OmniRoute Bridge</h1><p class="subtitle">Local AI Control Center · V2 Foundation</p>
  <section class="section"><h2>System health</h2>
    <div id="system-health" aria-live="polite">Đang kiểm tra…</div>
    <button id="refresh" type="button">Làm mới trạng thái</button>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><h2>Kết nối OmniRoute</h2>
    <form id="omni-form">
      <div class="form-group"><label for="baseUrl">Base URL</label><input type="url" id="baseUrl" value="<%= defaultBaseUrl %>" required></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="apiKey">OmniRoute API key</label><input type="password" id="apiKey" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Nhập API key" required></div>
      <button id="check" type="submit">Kiểm tra kết nối & tải model</button>
    </form>
    <p id="connection-status" class="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
  <section class="section" id="model-section" hidden><h2>Model & cấu hình OpenClaw</h2>
    <div class="form-group"><label for="model-select">Model</label><select id="model-select"></select></div>
    <label class="checkbox"><input id="restart-after" type="checkbox"> Restart OpenClaw sau khi áp dụng</label>
    <button id="configure" type="button">Áp dụng cấu hình</button>
    <p id="config-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <details><summary>Kiểm tra model trực tiếp qua OmniRoute</summary>
      <p>Đây là phép thử API riêng, có thể phát sinh phí. Chat qua OpenClaw sẽ được bổ sung ở Phase 3.</p>
      <label for="chat-prompt">Prompt kiểm tra</label><input type="text" id="chat-prompt" placeholder="Nhập nội dung test…">
      <button id="test" type="button">Gửi phép thử model</button><pre id="chat-result" aria-live="polite"></pre>
    </details>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><h2>OpenClaw runtime</h2>
    <p>Runtime sử dụng Gateway service của OpenClaw. Nếu chưa có service, chạy <code>openclaw gateway install</code> trong terminal trước.</p>
    <div class="actions"><button data-runtime="start" type="button">Start</button><button data-runtime="stop" type="button">Stop</button><button data-runtime="restart" type="button">Restart</button></div>
    <p id="runtime-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><h2>Runtime logs</h2>
    <label for="log-lines">Số dòng (1–500)</label><input id="log-lines" type="number" min="1" max="500" value="100">
    <button id="logs" type="button">Xem logs</button><p id="log-source"></p><pre id="log-output" aria-live="polite"></pre>
  </section>
</main></body></html>
